<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Aviso de stock agotado</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; background: #f3f6fb; color: #17324d; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
      .shell { max-width: 640px; margin: 24px auto; background: #ffffff; }
      .hero { padding: 24px 32px; background: #14395c; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; }
      .content { padding: 28px 32px; }
      .product { padding: 20px; background: #f7f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5ebf2; }
      .product img { display: block; max-width: 180px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto 16px; }
      .label { color: #5b6f84; font-weight: 700; }
      .button { display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px 20px; background: #e84d0e; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <table class="shell" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
      <tr><td class="hero"><h1>Aviso de stock agotado</h1></td></tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="content">
          <p>Una variante de producto se quedó sin existencias.</p>
          <div class="product">
            {{#if image_url}}<img src="{{image_url}}" alt="{{product_name}} - {{variant_name}}">{{/if}}
            <p><span class="label">Producto:</span> {{product_name}}</p>
            <p><span class="label">Variante:</span> {{variant_name}}</p>
            <p><span class="label">SKU:</span> {{variant_sku}}</p>
            <p><span class="label">Cantidad actual:</span> {{inventory_quantity}}</p>
            <a class="button" href="{{product_url}}">Ver producto</a>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      {{> footer}}
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
